OL,3,CFour men killed in crash died from
OL,4,Cmultiple injuries, coroner's court
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FFour men killed in a car crash died
OL,8,Ffrom multiple injuries, a coroner's
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FPolice received reports that a black
OL,12,FSeat Cupra Formentor had hit a
OL,13,Flamppost on East Prescot Road, Huyton,
OL,14,FMerseyside in the early hours of
OL,15,FFriday 24 July.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
