OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786537137
OL,3,CFour men killed in crash died from
OL,4,Cmultiple injuries, coroner's court
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FJack Diggle, 23, Benjamin Dooley, 23,
OL,8,FAndrew Roberts, 24, and Craig
OL,9,FShackleton-Brady, 26, were all
OL,10,Fpronounced dead at the scene when
OL,11,Fpolice were called to reports that a
OL,12,Fcar had come off the road after
OL,13,Fcrashing into a lamppost on East
OL,14,FPrescot Road.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
