OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786537137
OL,3,CFour men killed in crash died from
OL,4,Cmultiple injuries, coroner's court
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FOpening their inquests at Bootle Town
OL,8,FHall on Wednesday 12 August, senior
OL,9,Fcoroner for Sefton Anita Bhardwaj
OL,10,Fheard the four men were identified by
OL,11,Ftheir dental records, as well as by
OL,12,Fclothing which they were seen to be
OL,13,Fwearing on CCTV footage earlier in the
OL,14,Fevening.
OL,16,FCoroner's officer Liam Moss told the
OL,17,Fcourt the single-vehicle collision
OL,18,Fhappened at 1.54am on the eastbound
OL,19,Fcarriageway of the road.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
