OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786537137
OL,3,CFour men killed in crash died from
OL,4,Cmultiple injuries, coroner's court
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FHe said: "The collision resulted in
OL,8,Fthe deaths of four of the five
OL,9,Foccupants of the vehicle."
OL,11,FThe cause of death for the four men
OL,12,Fwas given as multiple injuries.
OL,14,FThe brief hearing was told Mr Dooley,
OL,15,Fof Stockbridge Village, was a student
OL,16,Fand Mr Shackleton-Brady, from Dovecot,
OL,17,Fwas a warehouse operative.
OL,19,FMr Diggle, of West Derby, and Mr
OL,20,FRoberts, of Dovecot, were both
OL,21,Funemployed, the court heard.
OL,26,@oD@JOUqD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
