OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786537137
OL,3,CFour men killed in crash died from
OL,4,Cmultiple injuries, coroner's court
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FJames Diggle, 27, of West Derby, has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with four counts of
OL,9,Faiding and abetting causing death by
OL,10,Fdangerous driving and is due to appear
OL,11,Fat Liverpool Crown Court next month.
OL,13,FMs Bhardwaj formally opened the
OL,14,Finquests and suspended them to await
OL,15,Fthe outcome of criminal proceedings.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
